{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16149","headline":"和少府崔卿微雪早朝 · 王建","name":"和少府崔卿微雪早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬莱春雪晓犹残，点地成花遶百官。\n已傍祥鸾迷殿角，还穿瑞草入袍襴。\n无多白玉阶前湿，积渐青松叶上乾。\n粉画南山棱郭出，初晴一半隔云看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}